---
/**
 * @category FAQ
 * @theme starquix
 * @name FAQ
 */
---
<section class='bg-stone-50 px-4 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-28 xl:px-16 xl:py-32 dark:bg-stone-900'>
  <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-8'>
    <div class='flex flex-col gap-5 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between md:gap-10 xl:col-span-4 xl:flex-col xl:items-start xl:justify-start xl:gap-6'>
      <h2 class='m-0 font-sans text-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.04em] text-stone-900 text-balance md:text-6xl xl:text-[4rem] dark:text-stone-50'>Otázky</h2>
      <div class='flex flex-col gap-3 md:max-w-sm'>
        <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Odpovědi k otevírací době, objednávkám dortů a tomu, co dnes vyšlo z pece.</p>
        <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm leading-normal text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'>Něco jiného? <a href='#' class='font-medium text-stone-900 underline underline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50 dark:focus-visible:outline-stone-50'>Napište podpoře</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class='flex flex-col border-0 border-b border-solid border-stone-200 xl:col-span-8 dark:border-stone-700'>
      <details class='group border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700' open>
        <summary class='flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 py-6 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:focus-visible:outline-stone-50 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden'>
          <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 md:text-xl dark:text-stone-50'>Musím dort objednat aspoň dva dny předem?</h3>
          <svg class='mt-0.5 size-6 shrink-0 text-stone-900 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-open:rotate-45 dark:text-stone-50' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-linecap='round' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M12 5v14M5 12h14' /></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class='m-0 max-w-[40rem] pb-6 pr-12 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Ne. Sekce přidáváte, text upravujete přímo na místě a mezery, barvu a písmo měníte v panelu Návrh. Když kód přece jen píšete, otevřete stejné soubory ve svém editoru a změny se načtou.</p>
      </details>
      <details class='group border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700'>
        <summary class='flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 py-6 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:focus-visible:outline-stone-50 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden'>
          <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 md:text-xl dark:text-stone-50'>Dá se objednat i chleba, který není každý den ve vitríně?</h3>
          <svg class='mt-0.5 size-6 shrink-0 text-stone-900 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-open:rotate-45 dark:text-stone-50' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-linecap='round' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M12 5v14M5 12h14' /></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class='m-0 max-w-[40rem] pb-6 pr-12 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Ano. Zvolte Import a vyberte složku projektu. Editor pracuje s kopií, ponechá vaše stránky a komponenty a stránky v Markdown otevře jako MDX, abyste je mohli upravit na plátně.</p>
      </details>
      <details class='group border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700'>
        <summary class='flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 py-6 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:focus-visible:outline-stone-50 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden'>
          <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 md:text-xl dark:text-stone-50'>Kde se uchovávají moje soubory?</h3>
          <svg class='mt-0.5 size-6 shrink-0 text-stone-900 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-open:rotate-45 dark:text-stone-50' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-linecap='round' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M12 5v14M5 12h14' /></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class='m-0 max-w-[40rem] pb-6 pr-12 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Na vašem Macu, v běžné složce projektu Astro. Uložte ji do Gitu, otevřete ji v libovolném editoru kódu, nebo ji kdykoli vyexportujte jako zip.</p>
      </details>
      <details class='group border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700'>
        <summary class='flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 py-6 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:focus-visible:outline-stone-50 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden'>
          <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 md:text-xl dark:text-stone-50'>Jak zveřejním web na vlastní doméně?</h3>
          <svg class='mt-0.5 size-6 shrink-0 text-stone-900 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-open:rotate-45 dark:text-stone-50' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-linecap='round' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M12 5v14M5 12h14' /></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class='m-0 max-w-[40rem] pb-6 pr-12 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Stiskněte Publikovat a web se sestaví a nasadí. V tarifu Pro přidejte doménu v nastavení publikování a nasměrujte záznamy DNS na adresu, která se tam ukáže.</p>
      </details>
      <details class='group border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700'>
        <summary class='flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 py-6 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:focus-visible:outline-stone-50 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden'>
          <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 md:text-xl dark:text-stone-50'>Které verze Astro a Tailwind jsou podporované?</h3>
          <svg class='mt-0.5 size-6 shrink-0 text-stone-900 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-open:rotate-45 dark:text-stone-50' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-linecap='round' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M12 5v14M5 12h14' /></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class='m-0 max-w-[40rem] pb-6 pr-12 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Nové projekty začínají na Astro 7 s Tailwind CSS 3.4. Importované weby si nechají ty verze Astro a Tailwind, které už používají.</p>
      </details>
      <details class='group border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700'>
        <summary class='flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 py-6 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:focus-visible:outline-stone-50 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden'>
          <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 md:text-xl dark:text-stone-50'>Co se stane s mým webem, když ho zruším?</h3>
          <svg class='mt-0.5 size-6 shrink-0 text-stone-900 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-open:rotate-45 dark:text-stone-50' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-linecap='round' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M12 5v14M5 12h14' /></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class='m-0 max-w-[40rem] pb-6 pr-12 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Zůstane online na subdoméně a složka projektu zůstane na vašem Macu. Vlastní domény se vrátí, až tarif znovu zvýšíte.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
